'''Stormwrought Descent''' is the second section of the [[Stormwrought Ruins]] dungeon. It can be accessed with the [[Key to Stormwrought Castle]] either from [[Stormwrought Castle (Stormwrought Ruins)|Stormwrought Castle]] through the [[Stormwrought Prison|prison]], or through the side entrance at [[Treacherous Crags]]. It encompasses the lower sanctum and caverns beneath the castle that have been occupied by the [[Shadow Council]]. [[Chieftain Stormsong]] stands guard at the gate between the prison and the inner descent.

